@startuml
' Follow-up must refresh main context
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor User
participant "BTW History Panel" as UI
participant "BtwRemote" as Remote
participant "BtwCoordinator" as Coord
participant "Main Context Snapshot" as Capture
participant "Topic Repository" as Repo
participant "Side LLM" as LLM

User -> UI : select Topic A; press Follow
UI -> Remote : ask(sessionId, topicId=A, Q2, requestId)
Remote -> Coord : authorize and reserve
Coord -> Capture : capture current main @ t2
Capture --> Coord : ContextCut t2 (new since Q1)
Coord -> Repo : load Topic A at revision R
Repo --> Coord : Q1/A1, status complete
Coord -> Coord : assemble Main(t2) + Q1/A1 + Q2
Coord -> Repo : compare revision; append Q2 running
Repo --> Coord : durable new revision R+1
Coord -> LLM : independent side request
Coord --> UI : admitted
LLM --> UI : watch streamed answer A2
LLM --> Coord : settled answer
Coord -> Repo : persist A2 complete
Repo --> Coord : durable
Coord --> UI : settled Topic A
note over Coord,LLM
  No Topic B history.
  Main context is NOT frozen at t1.
end note
@enduml
